# UI

- Reuse existing shadcn components and project tokens before creating custom primitives.
- Keep Russian labels natural; do not mix Russian UI with English product verbs.
- Buttons/inputs/dialogs need accessible names/labels.
- Keyboard and focus behavior must remain usable.
- Avoid page-level horizontal overflow on supported layouts.
- Do not redesign unrelated screens while implementing a focused task.
- UI Reviewer is NOT automatic for every UI edit. Use it for a significant new screen, Designer/public UI, or when visual acceptance is uncertain.
